  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s objective is to promote better governance in Oecussi region by strength ZEESM TL and RAEOA capacity to invest and support regional sustainable development. Will continue to support the operationalization of special Administrative Region (SAR) and the special Zones for Social Market Economy and to strengthen institutional capacity to deliver services to the people of Oecussi. Programme focus on policy innovation in order to improve service delivery in key areas of regional developme</narrative>
  </description>
